    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>The curb.</b> A cube 7.4 \xD7 0.18 \xD7 1.7 m (<i>Curb</i>), and on top of it a thin lip 7.5 \xD7 0.03 \xD7 1.8 m (<i>Curb Lip</i>). The lip sticks out slightly: that small edge catches a highlight and makes the curb read as a solid block."
